{
    "background_story": "Maci was a pastry chef with a sweet tooth and a passion for Italian desserts. Growing up in a family of Italian descent, she was always fascinated by the art of creating traditional treats. Her specialty was tiramisu, a classic Italian dessert that she perfected over the years. Maci's tiramisu was renowned for its creamy mascarpone cheese, rich espresso, and delicate ladyfingers. She spent years experimenting with different flavors and techniques, eventually opening her own bakery, 'Bella Vita.' The bakery quickly became a sensation, with customers lining up for a taste of Maci's heavenly tiramisu. Her dedication to using only the finest ingredients and traditional methods earned her a reputation as one of the city's top pastry chefs, and her tiramisu remained the star of the show.",
